This plugin ships the prebuilt helper framework and the driver script of
mediaremote-adapter, and invokes them from /usr/bin/perl at runtime.

mediaremote-adapter
Copyright (c) 2025 Jonas van den Berg
https://github.com/ungive/mediaremote-adapter

Licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License; the full license text is in
Vendor/mediaremote-adapter/LICENSE, and the original copyright headers are
kept verbatim in every vendored source file.

Nothing is copied into this directory: the framework is compiled from
Vendor/mediaremote-adapter by scripts/build.sh and the driver script is copied
from the same place, both landing in the plugin bundle under
Contents/Resources/Bridge/ at packaging time. See
Vendor/mediaremote-adapter/VENDORED.md for the exact file subset taken, what was
deliberately left out, and the upgrade procedure.
